        "accuracy": 0.4430379746835443
      },
      {
        "chunk": "He's on three antihypertensives: hydrochlorothiazide (diuretic), lisinopril (ACE inhibitor), and amlodipine (calcium channel blocker).",
        "chunk_idx": 30,
        "summary": "list antihypertensives",
        "function_tags": [
          "case_representation"
